[color=#f1c232][size=5][b]
HORSIE GO WHERE HORSIE LOOK*.
RDR2 style "horse relative" mount controls.[/b][/size][/color]
* and Wagon, Ibex, Camel, Snow Deer, Boar, Bear, Wolf, Tiger, Lion, Iguana, Raptor, Kuku Bird (steering works while gliding too), elephant?

I do not like horse being tied to the camera. I wanna look around while riding. That is what this mod does.


[color=#f1c232][size=4][b]What do?[/b][/size][/color]

[list]
[*]Horsie go where horsie look! You look but horsie not care. Horsie go where horsie look. (why am I writing like this?)[/*]
[*]Change where horsie look with A and D (or stick). So easy.[/*]
[*]Horsie can reverse now. Like... walk backwards. Waow.[/*]
[*]Wagon go where horsie look![/*]
[*]Wagon reverse with S key (or down on stick). Still reverse with normal button too.[/*]
[*]Taming minigame still stupid! (I ain't fixing that).[/*]
[/list]


[color=#f1c232][size=4][b]Controls:[/b][/size][/color]

[list]
[*]Proper horse controls[/*]
[*][b]F5[/b] - Toggle the mod on/off.[/*]
[*]Reversing turns the wrong way for brain? Set [b]InvertSteer=0[/b] in the ini.[/*]
[/list]

[size=2][i]Technically controller should be supported but I cannot test this. If it works on controller, cool! Otherwise, feedback wanted.[/i][/size]



[color=#f1c232][size=4][b]Settings:[/b][/size][/color]

[spoiler]
All in [b]ProperHorseControls.ini[/b], next to the asi in [b]bin64[/b]. Restart game after edit.

[b][Keys] Toggle[/b]
Key to turn the mod on/off. Default F5. F1-F24, A-Z, 0-9, Numpad0-Numpad9, Insert, Delete, Home, End, PageUp, PageDown, Pause or ScrollLock. Not W, A, S or D.

[b][Reverse] InvertSteer[/b]
Which way A and D turn horsie when reversing. Default 1, set 0 to flip it. Works on wagon too.

[b][BackwardSpeed][/b]
How fast each kind of mount walks backward, 0.2 to 6 m/s. Ibex uses the horse value, snow deer uses reindeer, tiger and lion use Wolf_Elite.

[b][Debug] Logging[/b]
Default 0. Set 1 if you're reporting a bug and want to send me logs. About 10MB per hour of riding, and they get wiped every game start, so save them before relaunching.[/spoiler]



[color=#f1c232][size=4][b]Installation:[/b][/size][/color]

[list]
[*][b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/crimsondesert/mods/633]DMM[/url]:[/b] add the downloaded zip as a mod, enable it and apply.[/*]
[*][b]Manual:[/b] copy [b]ProperHorseControls.asi[/b] and [b]ProperHorseControls.ini[/b] from the [b]ProperHorseControls[/b] folder into the game's [b]bin64[/b] folder. Requires ASI loader.[/*]
[*]Uninstalling?: remove both files from [b]bin64[/b].[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b][color=#f1c232]Known issues:[/color][/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Wagon reversing is still dogshit, just like base game. I ain't touching that.[/*]
[*]After winning the taming minigame, the horse controls can freeze if you choose to ride it immediately. Dismount and remount to fix it[/*]
[*]Should keep working with game updates, but if not, patch will come soon. Please wait :)[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b][color=#f1c232]Compatibility:[/color][/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Any mod that changes mount or riding inputs will probably conflict[/*]
[/list]
